      "target": "raw_value location-side class",
      "smoothing": "Add-one (alpha=1) over K classes observed globally in TRAIN within each decade x result_family cell. If the whole cell is unseen in TRAIN, fall back to the add-one-smoothed global TRAIN class distribution. A class absent inside a seen cell receives count zero before smoothing.",
      "results": {
